  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iNG1TLm.png\" width=\"945\" height=\"116\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><strong>特色功能：</strong></span></p><p>覺得 Minecraft 字體看起來怪怪的嗎？</p><p>這個材質包將為您解決這個問題！</p><p>它基於 Faithful 32 材質包（但經修改）</p><p>僅針對 Minecraft 字體（文字、數字等）進行修改</p><p>支援所有版本！</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><strong>注意事項：</strong></span></p><p>支援模組</p><p>歡迎將此材質包加入您的模組包中</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><strong>範例：</strong></span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/457/256/310/172/2.png\" width=\"404\" height=\"185\"></span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">更多內容請見 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/smooth-font/screenshots\" rel=\"nofollow\">圖片</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">非常感謝百萬次下載！</span></strong></span></p>",
